$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=bllelen  LOC_AFTER=?

* The bit length of the value of a bit word is at most its length (Lean: bl_le_length).

s1::id |- ( L e. Word 2o -> L e. Word 2o )
i2::tonatcl
s3:s1,i2:syl |- ( L e. Word 2o -> ( toNat ` L ) e. NN0 )
i4::lencl
s5:s1,i4:syl |- ( L e. Word 2o -> ( # ` L ) e. NN0 )
i6::tonatlt
s7:s1,i6:syl |- ( L e. Word 2o -> ( toNat ` L ) < ( 2 ^ ( # ` L ) ) )
i8::blle
qed:s3,s5,s7,i8:syl3anc |- ( L e. Word 2o -> ( bl ` ( toNat ` L ) ) <_ ( # ` L ) )
$)
